{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2021-05-28 11:45:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY COMPLETES SALE OF INDIAN POINT ENERGY CENTER TO HOLTEC', 'text': 'BUCHANAN, N.Y., MAY 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENTERGY CORPORATION (NYSE: ETR) TODAY COMPLETED THE SALE OF THE SUBSIDIARIES THAT OWN INDIAN POINT ENERGY CENTER TO A HOLTEC INTERNATIONAL SUBSIDIARY, WHICH PLANS TO COMPLETE MAJOR DECOMMISSIONING ACTIVITIES AT THE SITE DECADES SOONER THAN IF ENTERGY HAD CONTINUED TO OWN THE FACILITY.'}